  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Funded Staff Resource</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme funded roles will be M&amp;E advisers that will be accredited to the FCDO Evaluation and/ or GSR cadres. They will lead on learning, coordination, communication, and facilitate uptake and use of outputs with programme teams, strategy and policy stakeholders across ICF spending departments. The advisers will provide MEL technical advisory support to programmes (especially those high value, innovative or risky without MEL expert advisory support). The roles will support the wider network by helping posts establish evaluation plans and pull together learning to make country portfolios (even beyond climate programming) more resilient to climate shocks and more sensitive to climate risks.</narrative>
  </description>
